# ============================================================
#  ASP.NET Core — Web API & MVC
# ============================================================
# User secrets & sensitive config (never commit)
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Staging.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json

# Static / compiled assets (front-end build output inside wwwroot)
**/wwwroot/dist/
**/wwwroot/lib/
**/wwwroot/css/bundle*
**/wwwroot/js/bundle*
**/wwwroot/images/uploads/
# Modül/medya-türü yükleme klasörleri (Round 11 — FileService bunlara yazar)
**/wwwroot/blogs/
**/wwwroot/projects/
**/wwwroot/musics/
**/wwwroot/users/
**/wwwroot/chats/
**/wwwroot/misc/

# User uploaded files & temporary assets
Tool/*/docs/

